{
  "public_post": "Good news, Millbrook! We have received a certified safe flour shipment and are back to baking today. All previous loaves have been recalled and refunds issued. To thank you for your patience, anyone who purchased bread this week can claim a free loaf today. Your health is our priority – see us at the bakery for fresh, safe bread!",
