  "coop_message": "Team, ensure we have enough free‑loaf vouchers for today and record each distribution; continue daily health check‑ins with the clinic and forward any new reports; contact the regional health department for an update on their investigation and request guidance on any lingering cases; let's run a modest 10% discount on all safe loaves to boost sales while we cover costs.",
